<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Seiko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Seiko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 45.55		vs	   43.11</p>
<p> Operating	  828    million    vs	    1.49</p>
<p> Current		2.38		vs	    2.64</p>
<p> Net		    1.34		vs	    1.34</p>
<p> EPS		    7.54 yen	  vs	    7.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    178 million	  vs	 178 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Seiko Co Ltd manufactures multi-purpose airconditioners and other consumer electronics.</p>
